# VN-110 AHRS ROS2 Node

ROS2 bridge for the VectorNav VN-110E AHRS sensor. Publishes IMU, attitude, and status data, accepts PX4 airspeed for velocity aiding, and supports real-time parameter tuning via Foxglove.

## Directory Structure

```
vn110_node/
└── src/
    ├── vn110_bridge/       # ROS2 node package
    │   ├── src/            # C++ source files
    │   ├── include/        # Headers
    │   ├── launch/         # Launch files
    │   ├── config/         # Default parameters (vn110_params.yaml)
    │   ├── CMakeLists.txt
    │   └── package.xml
    └── px4_msgs/           # PX4 message definitions (git submodule)
```

## Prerequisites

- ROS2 Humble
- VectorNav SDK (included in `../vnsdk/`)
- PX4 messages (pulled automatically as a git submodule)

## Build

```bash
cd vn110_node
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
colcon build
```

## Run

```bash
source install/setup.bash
ros2 launch vn110_bridge launch_with_recording.py
```

Override serial port:
```bash
ros2 launch vn110_bridge launch_with_recording.py port:=/dev/ttyUSB1
```

Disable rosbag recording prompt:
```bash
ros2 launch vn110_bridge launch_with_recording.py record:=false
```

## Configuration

Default parameters are in `src/vn110_bridge/config/vn110_params.yaml`. All parameters can be changed at runtime via Foxglove or `ros2 param set`.

### Connection

| Parameter   | Default        | Description                |
|-------------|----------------|----------------------------|
| `port`      | `/dev/ttyUSB0` | Serial port                |
| `baudrate`  | 921600         | Serial baud rate           |
| `ahrs_rate` | 200            | AHRS output rate (Hz)      |

### VPE (Attitude Estimation)

| Parameter              | Values                           | Description             |
|------------------------|----------------------------------|-------------------------|
| `vpe_heading_mode`     | 0=Absolute, 1=Relative, 2=Indoor| Heading estimation mode |
| `vpe_filtering_mode`   | 0=Unfiltered, 1=AdaptivelyFiltered | Filtering mode       |
| `vpe_tuning_mode`      | 0=Static, 1=Adaptive             | Tuning mode            |

### Velocity Aiding

| Parameter                    | Default | Description                          |
|------------------------------|---------|--------------------------------------|
| `velocity_aiding_enabled`    | true    | Enable airspeed velocity aiding      |
| `velocity_uncertainty`       | 0.1     | Measurement uncertainty (m/s)        |
| `velocity_aiding_threshold`  | 5.0     | Airspeed threshold (m/s)             |

### HSI (Hard/Soft Iron Calibration)

| Parameter              | Values              | Description                    |
|------------------------|---------------------|--------------------------------|
| `hsi_mode`             | 0=Off, 1=Run, 2=Reset | Real-time HSI estimation    |
| `hsi_apply_compensation`| true/false          | Apply HSI compensation         |
| `hsi_converge_rate`    | 1-5                  | Convergence speed              |

### Reference Frame Rotation

9-element DCM matrix (`ref_frame_rot_00` through `ref_frame_rot_22`) for sensor-to-vehicle frame alignment.

### World Magnetic/Gravity Model

| Parameter                | Default    | Description              |
|--------------------------|------------|--------------------------|
| `world_model_enabled`    | true       | Enable world model       |
| `world_model_latitude`   | 40.399     | Reference latitude       |
| `world_model_longitude`  | 49.811     | Reference longitude      |
| `world_model_altitude`   | 0.0        | Reference altitude (m)   |

## Topics

### Published

| Topic                              | Type                         | Description                    |
|------------------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------------|
| `/vn110/imu`                       | sensor_msgs/Imu              | Quaternion, gyro, accel        |
| `/vn110/euler`                     | geometry_msgs/Vector3Stamped | Roll, pitch, yaw (degrees)     |
| `/vn110/aided_velocity`            | geometry_msgs/Vector3Stamped | Airspeed received from PX4     |
| `/vn110/aided_velocity_sent`       | geometry_msgs/Vector3Stamped | Velocity sent to VN-110        |
| `/fmu/out/vehicle_attitude_euler`  | geometry_msgs/Vector3Stamped | PX4 attitude as Euler          |
| `/vn110/status/gyro`              | std_msgs/UInt8               | Gyro saturation status         |
| `/vn110/status/accel`             | std_msgs/UInt8               | Accel saturation status        |
| `/vn110/status/mag`               | std_msgs/UInt8               | Mag saturation status          |
| `/vn110/status/pressure`          | std_msgs/UInt8               | Pressure saturation status     |
| `/vn110/status/any_saturation`    | std_msgs/Bool                | Any sensor saturated           |

### Subscribed

| Topic                              | Type                         | Description                        |
|------------------------------------|------------------------------|------------------------------------|
| `/fmu/out/airspeed_validated`      | px4_msgs/AirspeedValidated   | PX4 airspeed for velocity aiding   |
| `/fmu/out/vehicle_attitude`        | px4_msgs/VehicleAttitude     | PX4 attitude (for comparison)      |
| `/fmu/out/sensor_combined`         | px4_msgs/SensorCombined      | PX4 IMU data                       |

## Services

| Service                    | Type             | Description                |
|----------------------------|------------------|----------------------------|
| `/vn110/write_settings`    | std_srvs/Trigger | Save settings to flash     |
| `/vn110/reset_sensor`      | std_srvs/Trigger | Reset sensor               |
| `/vn110/restore_factory`   | std_srvs/Trigger | Restore factory defaults   |

Settings changed via parameters are NOT automatically saved to flash. Call `/vn110/write_settings` to persist across power cycles.

## Troubleshooting

- **Sensor not detected:** Check USB connection, verify permissions (`sudo chmod 666 /dev/ttyUSB0`), check `dmesg | grep ttyUSB`
- **Parameter changes not taking effect:** Verify node is running and connected, check logs for errors
- **Settings lost after power cycle:** Call `/vn110/write_settings` service to save to flash
